{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/4b9b08b90d3320f3a8faf73ecf989b99.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/8e68fa83f8e5a179cfd956a435547eaa.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/9f0d5c8b9ac9a8ee50e5ec1ecbce094d.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/2f27e7637370a970ab1eb874879f21ee.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit <i>Amborettio</i>, Wanech transformed his trusty C.A.N. into a cozy green-themed pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings. The place hums with synthwave tracks, punctuated by chiptune sound effects, giving it a playful retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>top-down, casual cooking sim with arcade twists</strong>, you\u2019ll serve hungry customers by cooking food in a unique way: as meals rain down the screen, hit the correct <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> keys in sequence to prepare each order. Master the rhythm of the kitchen and deliver every plate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody really knows why Wanech traded adventure for appetizers\u2014though rumor has it, it\u2019s all to raise awareness for <i>Amborettio</i>. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: keep the pub buzzing, the customers smiling, and the orders flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Day","pa